---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={["subscribe-card", { compact }]}>
  <div>
    <span class="kicker">Stay in the loop</span>
    <h2>One useful engineering idea at a time.</h2>
    <p>Follow new .NET, Azure, AI architecture, career, and product-building notes through RSS today. Email delivery is coming next.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="subscribe-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}subscribe/`}>Choose how to follow <span>↗</span></a>
    <a class="button ink" href="https://github.com/surya99/surya-tech-codex" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on GitHub</a>
  </div>
</section>
